<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia EON 1996 net up 36.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia EON 1996 net up 36.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 454.43   vs	 333.15</p>
<p>    Shr	 (ringgit)	2.01   vs	   1.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		 6,968.49   vs     5,687.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   704.05   vs	 531.61</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  21.61   vs  less  13.15</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)     60.0    vs	  45.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Edaran Otomobil Nasional Bhd. It distributes Malaysia's national car Proton.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
